         IF VDP = TMS99X8
+                ; zerobas D-CHGMODRANGE (2026-11-19): A above 3 is not ignored -- the VG-8020
+                ; takes 4..$80 as SCREEN 3 and $81..$FF as SCREEN 0 (zerobas docs/bios/CHGMOD.md
+                ; R-CM-MODE), the mapping TOTEXT already makes (totext_map, main.asm). 2 B
+                ; longer, paid from INIGRP's NOPs below: only CHGMOD .. INIGRP move.
                 cp      4
